<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.10">
<l>cīraṇi māltiru nāmamē yiṭattēṟ ṟiya</l>
<l>vīraṇi tolpukaḻ viṭṭu cittaṉ viritta</l>
<l>vōraṇi yoṇtami ḻoṉpatō ṭoṉṟum vallavar</l>
<l>pēraṇi vaikuntat teṉṟumpē ṇiyirup parē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who master these one and nine</l> 
<l rend="indent">unique, effulgent Tamil [verses],</l>
<l>composed by Viṣṇucitta of ancient</l>
<l rend="indent">fame dressed in heroism,</l>
<l>that make clear to give the holy names of Māl,</l> 
<l rend="indent">adorned in perfection,</l>
<l>they with be forever esteemed in Vaikuntha of vast beauty.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
